Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.02,0:00:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time the rain no longer\Nfalls, and I see the sky,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.40,0:00:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I think back to when I was a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.38,0:00:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Who could only cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.02,0:00:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Blindly chasing after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.70,0:00:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I fell far behind my only thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.40,0:00:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,One day I will be stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.52,0:00:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Grattery and gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.02,0:00:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Fading with the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.60,0:00:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I stronger now than I was before?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.48,0:00:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Or as weak as back then?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.42,0:00:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.48,0:01:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But until I do, my voyage will not end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.24,0:01:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what's next, I'm\Nwalking straight ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.58,0:01:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's go, there's nothing\Nthat can stop us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.66,0:01:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Though time rolls on our side,\Nwe'll never let it pull us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.56,0:01:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And we may fall, but we'll\Nalways keep on standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.66,0:01:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way anything\Nwill take what I hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.28,0:01:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The voices inside me push\Nme to keep surviving.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.76,0:01:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go on. I'll get through.\NNo matter what I gotta do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.34,0:01:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The fiercest thoughts\Nof all can pour upon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.26,0:01:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care why in the\Nworld would I turn back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.14,0:01:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.38,0:01:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing that can stop us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.98,0:02:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Though time's not on our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.30,0:02:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never let it pull us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.94,0:02:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And we may fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.98,0:02:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But we'll always keep on standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.96,0:02:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way anything will take.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.56,0:02:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What I hope dear away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.18,0:02:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I know the future's there for us to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.08,0:02:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have time to get in a\Nfight with such a strong guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.90,0:02:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All I'm here to do is save Aix!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.52,0:02:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.43,0:02:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Second gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.38,0:02:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, we'll deal with fancy pants!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.72,0:02:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yee-haw-ha! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.34,0:03:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hawkeye!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.62,0:03:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember the time we challenged you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.72,0:03:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, here comes a blast of\Nthe past to kick your smug ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.34,0:03:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We're powered up now as new\Ncommas, and you're gonna feel it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.04,0:03:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Woo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.86,0:03:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't remember you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.92,0:03:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You're worms.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.38,0:03:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,In a long line of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.46,0:03:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.86,0:03:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep running and don't look back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.04,0:03:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're still in rage.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.78,0:04:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow! Man!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.36,0:04:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He got me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.44,0:04:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He's going in for the kill!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.06,0:04:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.16,0:04:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Gum-gum-gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.88,0:04:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Jet-bun-gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.56,0:04:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Too close.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.80,0:04:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He'd have sliced my arms\Nright off if I'd attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.38,0:04:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you're smarter than you look.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.68,0:05:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, a sword should not do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.98,0:05:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Could we please call that thing\Nsomething other than a sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.90,0:05:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,He's definitely earned that\Nworld's strongest swordsman title.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.54,0:05:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He's stronger than a mountain of ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.54,0:05:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way Strawhead's gonna\Nsurvive, not if he's fighting here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.42,0:05:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why you don't slice Icebergs!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.06,0:06:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop looking at me like you're my\Nequal because you're far from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.16,0:06:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If anything, you should\Nbe begging to work for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.56,0:06:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.84,0:06:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,and here I thought you'd\Nbeen humbled by prison
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.42,0:06:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,but not even impelled down\Ncould make a dent in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.48,0:06:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.44,0:06:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard enough talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.72,0:06:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Sable!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.92,0:06:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Get lost, you Gecko!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.64,0:06:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I assumed you could be reasoned\Nwith, but I was obviously mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.16,0:07:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,These dumb jawheads don't notice\Nyou if you don't try to fight them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.50,0:07:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We can just breathe through.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.22,0:07:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not a breeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.84,0:07:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Get in, Dock!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.80,0:07:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.71,0:07:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He literally got sucked in\Nfrom someone else's neck!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.50,0:07:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.30,0:07:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never make it to\Nyour brother in time!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.10,0:07:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You shall perish after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.82,0:07:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Just freezing through.\NNothing strange here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.60,0:07:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no denying his\Nfighting skills have improved.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.54,0:07:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But I've already seen all his moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.78,0:07:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no chance that I'll miss again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.68,0:07:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Not from such a close distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.46,0:07:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't find me. Just passing through.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.44,0:07:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice save.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.80,0:08:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Jet human shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.66,0:08:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.66,0:08:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll die!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.72,0:08:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.63,0:08:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't slice you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.92,0:08:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, I just heard\Nyou say, don't mind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.64,0:08:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.70,0:08:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no way your hearing\Nis that selfishly selective.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.56,0:08:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.88,0:08:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Human shield!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.36,0:08:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.32,0:08:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.98,0:08:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.89,0:08:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Your sword's not working.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.96,0:08:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Suffer the special\Nmuggy ball and blow off!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.36,0:08:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.92,0:08:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to hear a joke instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.70,0:08:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,How's the muggy ball like\Na robust financial market?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.68,0:08:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.59,0:08:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,How is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.51,0:08:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Say it together, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.42,0:08:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Because it goes... BOOM!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.92,0:08:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never heard that one before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.10,0:08:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice, Captain Buggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.16,0:08:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.52,0:08:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.62,0:08:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,See you in the afterlife, I guess!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.86,0:09:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not done.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.30,0:09:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Vista pop said to make\Nsure ace's brother doesn't
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.34,0:09:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Get killed now. Go back. Him\Nup certainly I shall make a
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.76,0:09:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We meet at last your reputation\Nprecedes you flower sword vista
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.06,0:09:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure to meet you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.08,0:09:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thrilled you've heard of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.78,0:09:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You can drop the false modesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.56,0:09:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that sucked.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.46,0:09:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That mustache guy, who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.58,0:09:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I see Straw Hat's true strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.52,0:09:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, thanks, whoever you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.00,0:09:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing to do with physical strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.46,0:10:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,His power is to rally those around him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.02,0:10:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the spirit, straw boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.04,0:10:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep running.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.16,0:10:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, save your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.44,0:10:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.64,0:10:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.60,0:10:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Of all the people seeking\Nto conquer the sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.00,0:10:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,he may possess the greatest talent of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.86,0:10:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.54,0:10:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,In the looming shadow of\NAce's impending execution,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.16,0:10:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,the world has been rocked by\None revelation after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.32,0:10:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It all began when more\Nthan 200 inmates managed
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.68,0:10:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,to escape from the iron-tight\Nprison of Impel Dawn,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.72,0:10:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,and the most notorious of those prisoners
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.58,0:10:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,have now taken a lead\Nrole in this epic battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.12,0:11:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The blood-soaked expanse of the ghastly\Nbattlefield is an unearthly sight,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.12,0:11:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,and with a single glance at its horrors,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.80,0:11:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,it's clear that this\Nshowdown will change history.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.82,0:11:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The populace of the world has no choice\Nbut to helplessly observe the events of
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.32,0:11:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,this war with the knowledge that its\Noutcome will determine their very future.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.26,0:11:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Fleet Admiral, everything\Nhas been arranged.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.68,0:11:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The bay is fully prepared\Nas well. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.48,0:11:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all set.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.56,0:11:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What they're already\Npreparing for the execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.68,0:11:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,those bastards they're\Npushing up the schedule?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.84,0:11:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they damn we don't have much time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.36,0:12:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on is it really\Nabout to happen that's
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.28,0:12:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,ridiculous why would\Nthey announce the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.80,0:12:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And then change it at the\Nlast minute have to feed
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.76,0:12:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,kill every single video\Nbroadcast out of this place!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.80,0:12:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,As representatives of\Nthe navy and the world
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.66,0:12:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,government we're fighting\Nto preserve the Righteous
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.24,0:12:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,cause of absolute justice\Nand we must prevail
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.62,0:12:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,even if that means stepping over the line!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.32,0:12:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's too much for this naive world\Nto understand let alone see there's
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.34,0:12:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,no reason To submit innocent citizens\Nto the horrific imagery about to unfold?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.28,0:12:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Pops.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.30,0:12:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Run faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.08,0:12:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, looks like they really are\Ngoing to execute Ace ahead of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.10,0:12:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.40,0:12:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The only news that should spread\Nthroughout the world after this war
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.84,0:12:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,is on our victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.86,0:12:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And the details are irrelevant.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.26,0:13:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,They're attacking our ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.54,0:13:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the Bayhead!\NThere's something out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.34,0:13:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty sure they're not on our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.50,0:13:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The Navy must have found a way to get some
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.12,0:13:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,reinforcements around\Nthe ice wall somehow?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.08,0:13:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But are they admirals?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.96,0:13:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, these guys are blowing up ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.18,0:13:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't they be up front?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.44,0:13:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.08,0:13:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.99,0:13:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.20,0:13:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, I wondered when I'd get a\Nglimpse of the government's human weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.58,0:14:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's that big bear guy or I guess\NI mean guys, there's so many.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.38,0:14:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm confused a mere hour\Nand a half has passed
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.40,0:14:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,since the war began but\Nthe navy aims to end it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.58,0:14:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,In one strike with this critical\Npush, the tide of the war
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.56,0:14:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,has once again changed course\Nflowing into its final stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.40,0:14:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of waiting
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.14,0:14:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,let's get this done!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.50,0:14:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They all look just like the warlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.46,0:14:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuma no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.86,0:14:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gotta be some kind of an illusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.88,0:14:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Well this just got weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.66,0:15:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I know those guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.66,0:15:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They went on a rampage here a while back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.98,0:15:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like having an army of warlords.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.94,0:15:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But there weren't that\Nmany when they attacked us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.56,0:15:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Head office!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.98,0:15:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Reporting in!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.36,0:15:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta hear this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.06,0:15:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello? Anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.74,0:15:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So this one's gotta be the\Nreal Kuma, right? I thought
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.42,0:15:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This was just some rumor,\Nbut I've heard word that Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.74,0:15:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Vegapunk has been working on some\Nkind of human weapon and he's been
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.06,0:15:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,shipping out The prototypes to back\Nup the navy this could be them well
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.10,0:15:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,that looks like a human weapon if\NI've Ever seen one sure but why are
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.08,0:16:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,They all Kuma. Hey, Uncle! This isn't\Nlooking like the plan we talked about!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.12,0:16:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought the pirates were supposed\Nto be rounded up inside the bay
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.40,0:16:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,so we could pick them off\Nlike fish in a barrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.84,0:16:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are they scattered all over the place?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.52,0:16:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe I've deciphered the Navy's plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.08,0:16:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They leaked the intel about the\Ndecision to expedite Ace's execution,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.38,0:16:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,knowing that it would send\Nus into a frenzy to save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.56,0:16:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,After that,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.58,0:16:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,all they had to do was slowly back up their\NForces to fully lure us pirates into the
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.62,0:16:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,bay and then they block off the bay head\Nwith their human weapons to close the trap
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.72,0:16:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,checkmate now it all\Nmakes sense that's why
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.70,0:16:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,White Beard ordered us\Nto sink those navy ships
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.02,0:16:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,instead of advancing he saw through their
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.68,0:16:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,plan if it weren't for\Nhim we would have been
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.02,0:16:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,trapped yeah we can still attack from the
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.52,0:16:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,front and the rear even\Nif they're not closed
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.40,0:16:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,in the bay stick to the plan and take down
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.10,0:17:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,the Allied forces first\Neliminate any parent
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.70,0:17:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,that's trying to stray from the enclosure
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.38,0:17:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,to advance and there
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.80,0:17:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,you go got it and if our
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.60,0:17:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,ships get caught in\Nthe crossfire let's try
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.82,0:17:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,to keep it to a minimum\Nokay so that's the plan
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.22,0:17:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Then time to work. Light up\Nas many kumas as you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.30,0:18:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Now fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.96,0:18:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a feast dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.10,0:18:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They vaporized them!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.62,0:18:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.36,0:18:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastards are even willing\Nto sacrifice their own men.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.64,0:18:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't lose faith!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.70,0:18:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,March on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.34,0:19:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge the plaza with all of your might!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.40,0:19:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The only retreat I know is death.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.06,0:19:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll rescue Ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.46,0:19:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Before they can send me down that road?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.70,0:19:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,All units get off the ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.54,0:19:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And defend the front line now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.94,0:19:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Do whatever it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.38,0:19:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,To ensure the pirates don't\Nreach the plaza? Go! Fall back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.08,0:19:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.10,0:19:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quite the unexpected\Npleasure to cross.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.04,0:19:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,blades with the world's\Ngreatest swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.20,0:19:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Your swordsmanship is of\Nno small renown either.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.72,0:19:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We were certain to cross paths.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.12,0:19:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Now show me your skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.32,0:20:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm happy to give you a peek!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.62,0:20:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What flowers would you like on your grave?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.32,0:20:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Onward!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.38,0:20:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Drive them in! Hell no!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.00,0:20:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,La sequence!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.68,0:20:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,How's that feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.58,0:20:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way those things\Nare made of flesh and bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.42,0:20:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, they're obviously not human.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.96,0:20:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.46,0:20:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to the screen?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.10,0:20:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what happened to the screen?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.96,0:21:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Struggle all you want, White Beard.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.20,0:21:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We still have the upper hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.06,0:21:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready to crush you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.08,0:21:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as every video feed has been cut,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.96,0:21:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,activate the encircling walls and once\Nthat's set, we will Immediately execute Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.36,0:21:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,and round up all of our remaining enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.12,0:21:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.96,0:21:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.44,0:21:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,They're about to kill\NAce! I'd better hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.62,0:21:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, back to square one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.54,0:21:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.26,0:22:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Bay!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.38,0:22:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The Admiral's getting in on the fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.56,0:22:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.60,0:22:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet we must press on regardless.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.16,0:22:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We knew we would face insurmountable\Nodds and undefeatable foes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.78,0:22:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Them sending out their best only means\Nwe're too close for their comfort.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.26,0:22:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to die, son of dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.38,0:22:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ace's brother, you're not\Nrunning out of steam, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.34,0:22:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,White Beard's commanders, we won't\Nfind any better backup than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.36,0:22:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't let one man halt\Nyour advance. Now follow us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.84,0:23:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's take them.\NThe name is pulling back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.52,0:23:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So now's our chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.62,0:23:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We're breaking through these bastards
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.66,0:23:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Lock here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.90,0:23:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a real fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.46,0:23:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if it isn't 10th\NDivision Commander Carol.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.50,0:23:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,look at that angry glower\Ndo you really want to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.76,0:23:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,With such a sour face you do realize you'll\Nbe buried in this bay if you stay here
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.32,0:23:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,first taste Will die and then your cronies\Nwill be trapped and wiped out i honestly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.40,0:23:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,couldn't care less about Who's gonna win
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.32,0:23:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This war, but watching\NWhite Beard die—that's
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.92,0:23:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,fun pops and ace won't\Ndie not while I'm around
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.58,0:23:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,shall
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.38,0:23:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,we put
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.29,0:24:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,this match on hold?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.21,0:24:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Vista
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.16,0:24:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Much as I hate to we do have\Nother matters to worry about
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.46,0:24:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to back down. So let's go,\NSmoker. Didn't you hear the orders?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.54,0:24:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.54,0:24:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.30,0:24:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.84,0:24:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, you can do it. Stay strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.16,0:24:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell hasn't\Nthe video feed been cut?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.82,0:24:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.76,0:24:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll just be another minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.28,0:24:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all set.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.68,0:24:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Gaffer, you're blocking the shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.00,0:24:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like they've cut all\Nthe camera feeds except for one.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.78,0:24:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.32,0:24:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this feed?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.32,0:25:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, is that who I think it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.58,0:25:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.44,0:25:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.34,0:25:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He's been laying low for\Nall these years, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.14,0:25:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He was a member of the legendary\Ncrew that served under Gold Roger,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.14,0:25:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,the king of the pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.06,0:25:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.04,0:25:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.18,0:25:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Can it really be the renowned\Npirate Captain Buggy? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.02,0:25:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, did someone say my name? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.80,0:25:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It is classified\Ninformation, but I admit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.20,0:25:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the legendary pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.12,0:25:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold it, Captain Page. Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.90,0:25:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got a nose blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.70,0:25:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Come out, sir, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.44,0:25:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, dammit.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.76,0:25:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is happening here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.56,0:25:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How many times have I ordered you\Nfools to cap the stupid video?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.90,0:25:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't move with the world watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.00,0:25:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.91,0:26:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.83,0:26:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm afraid that the\Nescaped prisoners have somehow
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.42,0:26:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,managed to steal one of the\Nvideo transponder snails from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.54,0:26:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.45,0:26:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you let this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.06,0:26:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Makeup.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.32,0:26:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready to roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.42,0:26:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, guys, mark it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.28,0:26:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Take two in three, two, one, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.04,0:26:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that who I think it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.36,0:26:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The legendary crew member\Nof Gold Roger and the
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.28,0:26:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,sworn brother of Shanks\Nof the Four Emperors?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.04,0:26:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it really be the\Nmythical pirate, Captain Buggy?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.76,0:26:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Did someone say my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.06,0:26:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop those idiots right this second!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.46,0:26:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that was close!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.26,0:26:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,They found us one for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.02,0:26:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I just saw you get sliced in\Nhalf by the infamous Haki Mihawk.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.94,0:26:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,but there's not even a scratch on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.08,0:26:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.50,0:26:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, I'm Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.04,0:27:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The living legend! Throw them away!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.26,0:27:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I want them dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.24,0:27:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut back to the war, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.70,0:27:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are we getting video of this moron?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.98,0:27:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Go back to Ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.10,0:27:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna miss the execution!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.84,0:27:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna see that army\Nof Bartholomew Kumars!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.86,0:27:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand tall, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.64,0:27:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't stop now!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.58,0:27:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Not until we know that\NAce is safe! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.16,0:27:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Pops.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.98,0:27:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Squad.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.66,0:27:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Good to see you're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.54,0:27:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, barely.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.58,0:27:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.50,0:27:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I was trying to reach you earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.94,0:28:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,How are things looking\Nat the bay head now?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.26,0:28:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to say, but your\Nallies were beaten pretty badly.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.52,0:28:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Little does he know it works in our favor\Nfor them to attack us from the rear.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.96,0:28:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm joining the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.66,0:28:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Our only chance is to\Nkeep pushing forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.48,0:28:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't agree more.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.76,0:28:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What's Squared doing up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.16,0:28:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You have 43 allied captains\Nwilling to die for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.80,0:28:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all in your debt,\Nfor now and for always.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.98,0:28:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We consider it a privilege to risk\Nour lives for you and your crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.46,0:28:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
